      "/api/gold/history": {
        "get": {
          "summary": "Get Gold History",
          "description": "Return the eval-run metric history for every class, oldest first.\n\nReads the append-only `state/eval-runs/**/*.json` records the Evals\nRun button writes (see `eval_run_store`) and groups them by class so\nthe overview can plot each class's outcome mix over time. One glob\npass for all classes (the overview lists them all) rather than a\nper-class endpoint that would re-walk the tree N times.\n\nBest-effort per file: an unreadable or malformed record is skipped\n(logged), never failing the whole history — partial evidence still\nplots. Matching never reads this back; it is display-only.",
          "operationId": "get_gold_history_api_gold_history_get",
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Successful Response",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "additionalProperties": true,
                    "type": "object",
                    "title": "Response Get Gold History Api Gold History Get"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "/api/feedback": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "Submit Feedback",
          "description": "Persist one feedback record as immutable JSON under `state/feedback`.\n\nAttribution is server-resolved: `product_commit` from served-product\nprovenance (`\"unknown\"` when no `source.json` stamp is present),\n`created_by` from the Easy Auth principal (`get_current_user`,\nNone in local dev). Missing provenance never blocks the write — the\nrecord marks the product version `unknown` and the response carries a\nwarning.\n\nA write that does not land raises `FeedbackWriteError`, surfaced here as\na structured 500. The app never reports a report as saved when the JSON\nfile was not written.",
          "operationId": "submit_feedback_api_feedback_post",
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FeedbackRequest"
                }
